{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"という台詞を聞いて、この赤ずきんちゃんは狼よりも怖いと思った私である。何故かわかるかしら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの、狼感の伝わらなさたるや。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/11/01/5954592/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/11/01/5954592/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装に合わせて\nコンタクトはグリーン&グレー！！\n眼の下にクマも作りました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/11/01/5954592/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/11/01/5954592/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/11/01/5954592/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"氣志團さんとのコラボも\n安定の楽しさで、本当に\n氣志團さんありがとうございました！！"}],"source":"archive"}